            <ArticleTitle>[Hallucinations of supernumerary limbs, left hemineglect and hypersexuality in a case of right capsulo-lenticular hematoma].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>587-90</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Following a right capsulo-lenticular hematoma, a 35-year-old man developed left sensory motor hemiplegia. Three years later, he still describes the existence of a supernumerary phantom limb. Mood disturbances, hypersexuality and attentional left hemineglect were also present.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
